[TITLE]
FILE-05: four time-based controls on two pipes; the comments give each time in seconds

[JUNCTIONS]
;ID   Elev  Demand
 J1   50    100
 J2   40    50

[RESERVOIRS]
;ID   Head
 R1   150

[PIPES]
;ID  N1  N2  Length  Diam  Rough  Mloss  Status
 P1  R1  J1  1000    12    100    0      Open
 P2  J1  J2  1000    8     100    0      Open

[CONTROLS]
 LINK P1 CLOSED AT TIME 0:20                 ;1200 s
 LINK P1 OPEN   AT TIME 6:20:01              ;22801 s
 LINK P2 CLOSED AT TIME 0:01:01              ;61 s
 LINK P2 OPEN   AT CLOCKTIME 8:00:01 AM      ;28801 s

[TIMES]
 Duration           12:00
 Hydraulic Timestep 1:00

[OPTIONS]
 Units     GPM

[END]
